0 FILE 10183 - 4 - Diesel-electric American locomotive.ldr
0 Diesel-electric American locomotive in red-and-black livery: plate-built chassis, grille-paneled body with cab windows, driver seat and control sticks, two single-axle bogies with magnetic couplings, and sloped front and rear noses
0 Name: 10183 - 4 - Diesel-electric American locomotive.ldr
0 Author: Bert Van Raemdonck [BEAVeR]
